WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:02.534
-Today is Friday, and that's
usually when I catch up

00:00:02.534 --> 00:00:03.834
on some personal stuff.

00:00:03.834 --> 00:00:05.033
You know, I check my inbox,
I return some e-mails,

00:00:05.033 --> 00:00:07.033
and, of course,
I send out thank-you notes.

00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:09.567
And I was just running
a bit behind today,

00:00:09.567 --> 00:00:11.200
so I thought if you guys
wouldn't mind, I would like to

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:12.601
write out my weekly
thank-you notes right now.

00:00:12.601 --> 00:00:13.801
Is that cool with you?

00:00:13.801 --> 00:00:15.934
[ Cheers and applause ]
Thank you very much.

00:00:15.934 --> 00:00:17.868
James, can I get some thank-you
note writing music, please?

00:00:17.868 --> 00:00:20.267
♪♪

00:00:20.267 --> 00:00:22.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.667 --> 00:00:24.200
It looks like he's got a secret
or something.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:25.334
-Wow.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:29.634
♪♪

00:00:29.634 --> 00:00:32.000
-Thank you, Christmas stockings,

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.534
because the only thing better
than getting socks for Christmas

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:37.067
is getting them
inside an even bigger sock.

00:00:37.067 --> 00:00:39.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:39.667 --> 00:00:40.901
-Ah!

00:00:40.901 --> 00:00:43.067
-Oh, yeah, a sock. How meta.
-A sock.

00:00:43.067 --> 00:00:44.767
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:44.767 --> 00:00:46.167
♪♪

00:00:46.167 --> 00:00:49.400
Thank you, seeing my own breath
when it's cold,

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:50.901
for being the closest
I'll ever come

00:00:50.901 --> 00:00:52.334
to doing vape tricks.

00:00:52.334 --> 00:00:54.033
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.033 --> 00:00:55.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:57.067 --> 00:00:58.334
♪♪

00:00:58.334 --> 00:01:01.067
Thank you,
tracking packages online,

00:01:01.067 --> 00:01:04.367
for letting me know that UPS,
FedEx, and the post office

00:01:04.367 --> 00:01:07.234
still have nothing
on Domino's Pizza Tracker.

00:01:07.234 --> 00:01:08.234
That thing works.

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:09.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:09.634 --> 00:01:10.701
That thing works.

00:01:10.701 --> 00:01:12.267
-Bing bong!

00:01:14.434 --> 00:01:15.601
♪♪

00:01:15.601 --> 00:01:18.367
-Thank you,
artificial Christmas trees,

00:01:18.367 --> 00:01:20.534
or as the rest of the plants
in your house put it,

00:01:20.534 --> 00:01:22.067
"Um, who is she?"

00:01:22.067 --> 00:01:24.400
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:29.767 --> 00:01:31.167
♪♪

00:01:31.167 --> 00:01:35.267
Thank you, licking a candy cane
into a pointy edge,

00:01:35.267 --> 00:01:37.834
for making me feel like
I'm in a North Pole prison.

00:01:37.834 --> 00:01:39.801
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:42.334 --> 00:01:43.968
-Herbie!
-[ Chuckles ]

00:01:43.968 --> 00:01:45.567
We're getting Herbie
out of here.

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:48.567
♪♪

00:01:48.567 --> 00:01:51.234
Thank you,
holiday family newsletters,

00:01:51.234 --> 00:01:53.567
for basically being
your aunt's way of saying,

00:01:53.567 --> 00:01:55.634
"Here's all the stuff you would
have seen me post this year

00:01:55.634 --> 00:01:57.334
if you hadn't muted me
on Facebook."

00:01:57.334 --> 00:01:58.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.834 --> 00:01:59.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:59.901 --> 00:02:01.467
Oh!
-Oh.

00:02:01.467 --> 00:02:02.701
Wow!

00:02:02.701 --> 00:02:04.601
-7-point font.
-[ Chuckles ]

00:02:05.367 --> 00:02:06.701
♪♪

00:02:06.701 --> 00:02:09.167
Thank you, paper snowflakes,

00:02:09.167 --> 00:02:11.834
for turning document shredding
into a family activity.

00:02:11.834 --> 00:02:14.167
[ Applause ]

00:02:14.167 --> 00:02:17.067
"Let's take daddy's taxes,
make it into a snowflake."

00:02:17.067 --> 00:02:18.133
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:18.133 --> 00:02:19.901
-Snowflake.

00:02:20.968 --> 00:02:22.267
♪♪

00:02:22.267 --> 00:02:25.400
-Thank you, gingerbread man,
for somehow being okay

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:27.701
living in a house
that's made out of you.

00:02:27.701 --> 00:02:30.300
There we have it, everybody.
Those are our thank-you notes.

